  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Little Sisters of the Assumption PROJECT: The aim of the Little Sisters of the Assumption work in Peru is to provide quality primary education to key target groups; children who have dropped out of education aswell as older children and adults through a supplementary Education Programme in after-school hours. The overall objective is to keep children in education and support those who dropped out with numeracy and literacy skills and ultimately seek employment opportunities. Key activities include provision of primary education, workshops in health promotion and prevention, citizenship, childens&apos; rights, and job skills</narrative>
  </description>
